gas price numbers are starting to come down.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:03.440
And I'm ready for all the right wingers&nbsp;
who blamed Biden for gas prices being up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:08.800
to praise him, for them being down. I'm ready.&nbsp;
I'm not expecting it. I'm not holding my breath,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:13.040
